      "side": 1,
      "message": "oh, that\u0027s an interesting new failure...\n```\nexternal/flatbuffers/include/flatbuffers/stl_emulation.h:284:29: error: non-type template argument evaluates to 4294967295, which cannot be narrowed to type \u0027ptrdiff_t\u0027 (aka \u0027int\u0027) [-Wc++11-narrowing]\nusing span \u003d std::span\u003cT, Extent\u003e;\n^\n```\nthis sounds like a problem that +rprichard is looking at right now ... it looks like the current version of flatbuffers might require a newer version of libc++ than we currently have?",
      "revId": "d8219792b5077dbf3370c84c756a048dbf1b62ea",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6b4387de_87351453",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 3
